{"id":"redstone-monstrosity","slug":"redstone-monstrosity","name":"红石巨兽","english":"Redstone Monstrosity","kind":"enemy","categoryKey":"bosses","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/database/renders-thumb-redstone-monstrosity.png","description":"","parameters":[["基础生命","2,400"],["基础伤害","25"],["韧性","1,200"],["灵魂","200"],["弱点","冰霜 ×1.5"],["最高单次伤害","25"],["速度","300"]],"tables":[{"title":"Where you fight it","columns":["WHEN","QUEST","WHERE"],"rows":[["Story quest","最终魂战","安眠丘陵"],["支线任务","安眠丘陵的孤寂","安眠丘陵"],["Dungeon boss room","End of the procedural dungeon","深暗之域地牢"],["Rematch","复活的红石巨兽","安眠丘陵"],["灵魂风暴、possible","20 minute storms every 40 minutes","咆哮树林、吟唱者草甸、多雨平原、轰鸣虫壳地、安眠丘陵、冰封高地、蜜脾原野"]]},{"title":"Moves","columns":["移动","效果","基础伤害","类型"],"rows":[["Left、right swipe","Opens the combo when you're close、at most once every 6 秒onds、and the right swipe always follows the left whether or not it hit. Each swing lunges forward as it lands、so roll sideways instead of backpedaling.","15",""],["Fist slam","The combo's third hit keeps tracking you until the fist comes down、hits harder than the swipes、starts a redstone ripple a short way in front of it.","25",""],["Redstone ripple","An expanding ring from the fist slam、the fist crush that damages you、sets you Burned. Jump or roll through it; each ring only hits you once.","15",""],["Redstone projectile","When you're far away it glows、spits three redstone bolts in quick succession across a 60 degree fan. They arc in、explode on impact for 10% of your max health as 爆炸 damage、leave you Burned、so keep strafing.","","爆炸"],["Charge","A wind-up、a burst of steam telegraph it、then it barrels at you for up to 3 秒onds at greatly boosted speed. It turns very slowly once moving、so a late sidestep works、and a hit launches you a long way.","25",""],["Fist crush","Comes only after a charge that connects: both fists slam down、send out two redstone ripples. Dodge the charge、you skip it entirely.","10",""],["Redstone core","It flashes、fires four or five cores that land on fixed spots in the arena. Each core shoots three rounds of four straight bolts、then bursts、and cores can't be hit、so stay off their firing lines、clear out before they pop.","15","火焰"],["Cube summon","A scream signals it、and 5 to 7 Redstone Cubes spawn around the arena、up to 15 alive at once. Each summoned cube is worth 20 souls.","",""]]},{"title":"变种","columns":["形态","基础生命","基础伤害","韧性","灵魂"],"rows":[["基础形态","2,400","25","1,200","200"],["灵魂风暴","700","25","700","200"]]},{"title":"弱点与抗性","columns":["属性","变化"],"rows":[["爆炸伤害","-25%"],["火焰伤害","-35%"],["冰霜伤害","+50%"]]},{"title":"原生属性（定义值）","native":true,"note":"解包表中的直接定义值；继承、难度与战力缩放另行计算。","columns":["定义","参数","数值"],"rows":[["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","爆炸伤害抗性倍率","0.75"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","火焰伤害抗性倍率","0.65"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","冰霜伤害抗性倍率","1.5"],["红石巨兽 · StormiRedstone","爆炸伤害抗性倍率","0.75"],["红石巨兽 · StormiRedstone","火焰伤害抗性倍率","0.65"],["红石巨兽 · StormiRedstone","冰霜伤害抗性倍率","1.5"],["红石巨兽 · StormiRedstone","生命","700"]]},{"title":"原生能力参数","native":true,"note":"保留能力的定义值与覆盖操作；未翻译的内部字段保留原名。","columns":["定义","能力","参数","数值","操作"],"rows":[["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Left","最大目标距离","500","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Left","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Left","触发权重","100","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Left","冷却时间","6","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Left","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Right","最大目标距离","600","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Right","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Right","触发权重","100","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Right","冷却时间","0","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Right","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Final","最大目标距离","1000","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Final","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Final","触发权重","100","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Final","冷却时间","0","定义值"],["红石巨兽 · MonstrosityRedStone","Final","激活期间允许再次触发","否","